WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,210
It seems that trying to pass toilet water off as mineral water won’t work.

2
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:06,890
The trading platform actually has regulatory functions

3
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:09,410
I won’t be afraid of buying fakes anymore.

4
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:12,580
The toilet will start every time it fills with water

5
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:15,380
So the water here is not available unconditionally.

6
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:17,380
If you start too many times

7
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:18,900
The toilet may run out of power

8
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:22,580
If the profit from sales cannot cover the cost of replacing the battery

9
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:25,150
Then there's no need to sell it

10
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:28,220
Well, you'll see if it's a good deal when you sell it.

11
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:39,630
One gold coin, four bottles of water, five loaves of bread

12
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:49,280
It's water, it can't be

13
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:52,000
Don’t worry, the bottles I gave you are clean mineral water.
